<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA 386-3 V SRI LANKA AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 386-3 V SRI LANKA AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 386-3 at lunch on the second day of the first test match against Sri Lanka in Colombo on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores India 386-3 (S. Tendulkar 112 not out, M.Azharuddin 73 not out)</p>
